{"id":"77e57ed488a01e39","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-atm.md","title":"交替图灵机","display":"df-atm — 交替图灵机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-atm","aliases":["29-df-atm"],"display":"df-atm — 交替图灵机","depends_on":["[[29-df-turing-machine]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 2.24, p.35, DjVu scan 50","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-atm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-atm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atm — 交替图灵机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 2.24, p.35, DjVu scan 50"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a> 的有限描述、配置和一步转移模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_T^\\circ=Q_T\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\}\">\\(Q_T^\\circ=Q_T\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall\\subseteq Q_T^\\circ\">\\(Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall\\subseteq Q_T^\\circ\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\">\\(M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\)</span>。接受与拒绝状态分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\)</span>；下式只增加非停机状态的两种标记。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ATM}\\coloneqq\\{M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\mid T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd},\\ Q_\\exists\\cap Q_\\forall=\\varnothing,\\ Q_\\exists\\cup Q_\\forall=Q_T^{\\circ}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ATM}\\coloneqq\\{M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\mid T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd},\\ Q_\\exists\\cap Q_\\forall=\\varnothing,\\ Q_\\exists\\cup Q_\\forall=Q_T^{\\circ}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_M\\coloneqq Q_T,\\quad\\delta_M\\coloneqq\\delta_T,\\quad q_0^M\\coloneqq q_0^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T,\\qquad M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_M\\coloneqq Q_T,\\quad\\delta_M\\coloneqq\\delta_T,\\quad q_0^M\\coloneqq q_0^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T,\\qquad M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Conf}_T,\\quad q_M\\coloneqq q_T,\\quad\\mathrm{Succ}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Succ}_T,\\quad\\mathrm{start}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{start}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Time}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Space}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Conf}_T,\\quad q_M\\coloneqq q_T,\\quad\\mathrm{Succ}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Succ}_T,\\quad\\mathrm{start}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{start}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Time}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Space}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.24，印刷页35、扫描页50。此前只写一个未分型的元组，未定义后续使用的机器集合 ATM，且状态划分可重叠。现将内部有限描述机器与新增交替标记分开。随机访问只读输入依原书本页约定；输入带不计入工作空间。接受的归纳语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aab8d6d79a93409\" href=\"?note=2aab8d6d79a93409\" title=\"29-df-atm-accept\">29-df-atm-accept</a>。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 的有限描述、配置和一步转移模型；$Q_T^\\circ=Q_T\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atm-accept","status":"resolved","id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Definition 2.24，印刷页35、扫描页50。此前只写一个未分型的元组，未定义后续使用的机器集合 ATM，且状态划分可重叠。现将内部有限描述机器与新增交替标记分开。随机访问只读输入依原书本页约定；输入带不计入工作空间。接受的归纳语义见 [[29-df-atm-accept]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_T^\\circ=Q_T\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall\\subseteq Q_T^\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ATM}\\coloneqq\\{M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\mid T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{nd},\\ Q_\\exists\\cap Q_\\forall=\\varnothing,\\ Q_\\exists\\cup Q_\\forall=Q_T^{\\circ}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q_M\\coloneqq Q_T,\\quad\\delta_M\\coloneqq\\delta_T,\\quad q_0^M\\coloneqq q_0^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{acc}}^T,\\quad q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{rej}}^T,\\qquad M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Conf}_T,\\quad q_M\\coloneqq q_T,\\quad\\mathrm{Succ}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Succ}_T,\\quad\\mathrm{start}_M\\coloneqq\\mathrm{start}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Time}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\quad\\operatorname{Space}_M\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Space}_T.","display":true}],"bytes":2218,"backlinks":[{"id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Time}_M(x)$ 为该输入所有分支的最大步数，非停机分支记为 $\\infty$；$\\operatorname{Space}_M(x)$ 为所有分支访问的最大工作带格数（含输入索引带）。这些是 [[29-df-atm]] 底层标准机器的资源接口。"},{"id":"2aab8d6d79a93409","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{start}_M(x)$ 是二进制输入串 $x$ 上的初始配置；$Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M$ 由 [[29-df-atm]] 的机器数据确定。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-atm]]、[[29-df-atm-accept]] — 交替图灵机及接受语义"},{"id":"9120c20ece14d350","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(T,Q_\\exists,Q_\\forall)\\in\\mathrm{ATM}$；$q_0^M$ 为初始状态，$q_M(c)$ 为配置状态，$\\mathrm{Succ}_M(c)$ 为一步后继集合，见 [[29-df-atm]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-atm]]"}]